Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,Drive over this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:01.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,road and it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.47,0:00:02.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,plays a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.53,0:00:03.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's cut with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:03.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,grooves like a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.63,0:00:04.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,giant vinyl record.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:05.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Each time a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.63,0:00:06.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,tire hits a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:07.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,groove, it makes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:07.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,a thump.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.01,0:00:08.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hundreds of thumps
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:09.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,a second blur
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.75,0:00:10.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,into one note.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:11.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Close grooves make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:12.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,a high note
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.45,0:00:13.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,and wider gaps
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.30,0:00:13.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,a lower one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.21,0:00:15.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Space them just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:15.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,right and the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:16.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,road plays
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:17.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,a melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.26,0:00:18.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Drive slower and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.21,0:00:19.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,the song slows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:19.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,down and drops
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.86,0:00:20.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,in pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.71,0:00:22.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,In California, one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:22.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,plays the William
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:23.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tell Overture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:24.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,But the crew
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.59,0:00:25.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,measured the gap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:26.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,between grooves, not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:27.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,groove to groove.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.57,0:00:28.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,So every note
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:29.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,came out flat,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:30.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,the high notes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:30.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,most of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.10,0:00:32.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's why California's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.30,0:00:33.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,famous musical road
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:33.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,is out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.83,0:00:34.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,of tune.
